     5	/- Equality on generated K items.  The generated syntax is inductive but does
     6	   not expose a DecidableEq instance, so use total classical decidable
     7	   equality to implement the map hooks. -/
     8	noncomputable def kItemEq (a b : SortKItem) : Bool := by
     9	  classical
    10	  exact decide (a = b)
    11	
    12	/- K map concatenation is disjoint union.  Generated SortMap values use an
    13	   association list; append is its total implementation and agrees with K on
    14	   well-formed maps, whose operand keys are disjoint. -/
    15	/- KORE symbol: Lbl'Unds'Map'Unds'; frozen source obligations: rule-746c49465cb8335d005b3a331b93eb26bdf586974933b9d025250760d4d0c29d, rule-82f2c726c84180f9e0c75a16a31dd3a15476f84ccb4dacad03db18bcaca52fda. Replace this stub with its honest total meaning from the frozen K semantics. -/
